{"id":"n89861-1-24","stage":0,"title":"목 · 脖子","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89861-1-24-1","ko":"목을 다쳤어요?","zh":"脖子受伤了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"목을","meaning":"脖子，颈","explanation":"목：脖子，颈；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"목","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89861","senseId":"1","lemma":"목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다쳤어요?","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5fbc9add7bd4911b","term":"목","zh":"脖子，颈","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3","entryId":"89861","definition":"连接人或动物头部和身体的纤细的部分。","pronunciation":["목"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7c8f0f0354b35b46e7f1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89861-1-24-2","ko":"네, 그래서 당분간 고개를 옆으로 돌릴 수가 없어요.","zh":"是的，所以暂时无法把头转到旁边。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"당분간","meaning":"暂时，暂且","explanation":"당분간：暂时，暂且","readings":[{"term":"당분간","audio":"/audio/8c78f09dbd688b308699.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14254","senseId":"1","lemma":"당분간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고개를","meaning":"头，脑袋","explanation":"고개：头，